WEBVTT

01:30.880 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:37.960
[Episode 9]

01:50.280 --> 01:51.220
Master Jin.

01:51.310 --> 01:52.120
Madam Jin.

01:52.350 --> 01:53.009
Manager Li.

01:53.479 --> 01:54.140
Manager Li.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.220
Manager Li.

01:56.000 --> 01:56.789
You're here.

01:57.509 --> 01:58.240
You're here.

01:58.530 --> 02:00.660
[Kindhearted and Serene]

02:10.240 --> 02:11.170
Please sit down.

02:19.800 --> 02:22.600
I am the eldest son of the Kang family,
Kang Suyuan.

02:23.150 --> 02:24.150
Nice to see you all.

02:24.150 --> 02:29.460
[Kindhearted and Serene]

02:24.700 --> 02:26.280
The fact that you've come today

02:26.280 --> 02:28.280
to help the Kang family out of this crisis

02:28.280 --> 02:29.560
is a great kindness.

02:29.910 --> 02:32.110
I won't thank each of you individually.

02:34.320 --> 02:35.180
Over the years,

02:35.910 --> 02:36.650
the Kang family's business

02:36.650 --> 02:38.050
has been smooth sailing,

02:38.420 --> 02:40.079
which made us arrogant enough

02:40.300 --> 02:41.630
to take on anything.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.980
This time, we accepted a court assignment

02:43.980 --> 02:45.680
to transport military supplies.

02:45.680 --> 02:47.810
We thought we could make a good profit,

02:48.030 --> 02:48.800
but inexplicably,

02:48.800 --> 02:51.130
a sudden fire burned everything to ashes.

02:51.910 --> 02:53.590
My father, in his distress,

02:54.280 --> 02:55.740
coughed up blood and died.

02:56.680 --> 02:59.200
I'm here in mourning clothes
to auction off our family property.

02:59.200 --> 03:00.530
What a disgrace of a son.

03:01.710 --> 03:03.110
But the country is at war,

03:03.680 --> 03:05.810
and people are dying by the thousands.

03:06.080 --> 03:08.150
If the military supplies problem
isn't solved,

03:08.150 --> 03:09.030
who knows how many more

03:09.030 --> 03:10.890
widows and orphans there will be.

03:11.840 --> 03:14.100
What are my troubles compared with that?

03:14.840 --> 03:16.030
So I invited you all here today

03:16.030 --> 03:17.520
to bid together.

03:21.780 --> 03:23.750
[Kindhearted and Serene]

03:30.400 --> 03:32.460
Here are all the Kang family's lands,

03:32.470 --> 03:33.030
houses,

03:33.360 --> 03:34.030
and shops,

03:34.880 --> 03:36.800
stretching from Shanxi to Shaanxi

03:36.800 --> 03:37.930
and down to Sichuan.

03:38.470 --> 03:40.560
There are about 40,000 mu
of good farmland,

03:40.560 --> 03:42.690
217 shops,

03:43.030 --> 03:44.079
and 3 large restaurants.

03:43.400 --> 03:44.120
[Kang Family's Property]

03:44.160 --> 03:46.020
[Total value: 7 million taels of silver]

03:44.840 --> 03:46.170
All our assets are here.

03:47.150 --> 03:48.350
If anyone has doubts,

03:48.960 --> 03:50.520
please come forward and take a look.

03:50.520 --> 03:52.010
With so much property,

03:52.360 --> 03:54.190
wouldn't it be better
to borrow money instead?

03:54.190 --> 03:55.560
Would the Eight Families

03:55.560 --> 03:57.290
really stand by and do nothing?

03:58.520 --> 03:59.410
Madam.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.120
Allow me to speak.

04:07.000 --> 04:07.860
Actually,

04:08.560 --> 04:09.450
these assets

04:09.870 --> 04:11.120
came from my ancestor,

04:11.120 --> 04:12.580
who failed in his studies,

04:12.680 --> 04:14.280
switched to learning a craft

04:14.400 --> 04:15.410
and failed again,

04:15.910 --> 04:16.870
and later found

04:17.120 --> 04:19.120
a petty clerk's job in the army camp,

04:20.120 --> 04:21.920
earning only a few maces a month.

04:22.680 --> 04:23.190
Later,

04:23.300 --> 04:24.390
he was put in charge of transporting goods

04:24.390 --> 04:25.190
for the army

04:26.120 --> 04:26.870
and met many heroes

04:26.870 --> 04:28.390
from all over the country.

04:28.720 --> 04:30.480
My great-grandfather
was generous, righteous,

04:30.480 --> 04:31.630
and a man of his word.

04:31.920 --> 04:33.650
Though he was physically weak,

04:33.800 --> 04:36.330
everyone respected him
as a true man of honor.

04:36.750 --> 04:38.080
Later, several friends

04:38.159 --> 04:40.120
pooled money
to open an escort agency for him,

04:40.120 --> 04:42.580
and that's when
he suddenly became wealthy.

04:43.750 --> 04:45.010
As the old saying goes,

04:45.480 --> 04:48.190
"a gentleman's fortune
lasts only three generations."

04:48.190 --> 04:50.120
Today marks the third generation.

04:50.560 --> 04:52.600
Although the Eight Families
take care of each other,

04:52.600 --> 04:54.310
my great-grandfather once vowed that

04:54.310 --> 04:56.110
he would never burden his peers.

04:56.920 --> 04:57.560
So today,

04:57.600 --> 05:00.240
I ask friends from all over to make way.

05:01.240 --> 05:03.830
Even if the Kangs
can't do business anymore,

05:03.870 --> 05:05.470
we must not lose our dignity.

05:06.950 --> 05:08.280
That's all I have to say.

05:11.630 --> 05:12.960
Please place your bids.

05:16.390 --> 05:17.750
Whoever can buy the Kang family

05:17.750 --> 05:19.150
will be quite something.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.240
So how will

05:20.310 --> 05:22.310
the Eight Families rank from now on?

05:22.510 --> 05:23.680
Who knows?

05:26.360 --> 05:26.960
Everyone,

05:27.270 --> 05:28.360
I'll start.

05:29.560 --> 05:30.620
Six million taels.

05:31.430 --> 05:32.030
Thank you.

05:33.430 --> 05:34.630
Seven million taels!

05:35.360 --> 05:36.490
Nine million taels!

05:36.750 --> 05:37.120
Thank you.

05:37.120 --> 05:38.380
Eleven million taels!

05:39.360 --> 05:40.690
Why aren't you bidding?

05:41.070 --> 05:42.400
I don't want the hassle.

05:43.510 --> 05:44.720
Our family already has so many shops

05:44.720 --> 05:46.650
that we can barely manage them all.

05:46.680 --> 05:47.430
You have no idea.

05:47.430 --> 05:49.290
The more money, the more trouble.

05:49.510 --> 05:51.110
That's a clever way to put it.

05:52.070 --> 05:52.830
If I were truly clever,

05:52.830 --> 05:54.159
I wouldn't even be here.

05:55.040 --> 05:56.440
Thirteen million taels!

05:56.920 --> 05:58.370
Fourteen million taels!

06:01.040 --> 06:01.800
Everyone,

06:02.950 --> 06:04.040
enjoy your meal.

06:05.190 --> 06:07.200
The auction won't end

06:07.270 --> 06:08.800
until this banquet is over.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.630
Everyone might as well take a look

06:10.220 --> 06:12.780
[Kindhearted and Serene]

06:11.120 --> 06:13.560
and think it over carefully.

06:17.270 --> 06:18.010
Ms. Su,

06:18.160 --> 06:20.000
why aren't you competing with them?

06:20.000 --> 06:22.130
My money doesn't grow on trees.

06:22.190 --> 06:24.430
Who wants to compete with them like that?

06:24.430 --> 06:25.090
So you can't

06:25.120 --> 06:26.190
win the property.

06:26.560 --> 06:27.820
Must it be about money?

06:28.800 --> 06:29.950
He's quite foolish.

06:30.750 --> 06:31.680
There are

06:31.720 --> 06:32.430
lots of things in this world

06:32.430 --> 06:33.890
more valuable than money.

06:34.750 --> 06:36.080
You'll see soon enough.

06:38.600 --> 06:40.000
More valuable things?

06:52.170 --> 06:55.340
[Kindhearted and Serene]

07:04.040 --> 07:05.100
Congratulations.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.600
Should I congratulate you now

07:07.600 --> 07:08.930
or wait a little longer?

07:09.680 --> 07:10.870
Congratulate me for what?

07:10.870 --> 07:13.470
For successfully joining
the Eight Families.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.120
Don't be ridiculous.

07:15.360 --> 07:17.040
There are plenty of rich people.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.700
Didn't you hear what she said?

07:19.000 --> 07:19.930
There are things

07:20.040 --> 07:21.590
more important than money.

07:23.070 --> 07:23.800
What things?

07:24.630 --> 07:25.430
Human lives.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.200
Someone's dead!

07:42.750 --> 07:43.680
Murder!

07:44.070 --> 07:45.159
Murder!

07:45.920 --> 07:46.850
Someone is dead!

07:47.360 --> 07:48.040
This...

07:49.720 --> 07:50.480
Here too!

07:51.310 --> 07:52.159
Here too!

07:53.600 --> 07:54.510
Here too!

07:54.680 --> 07:55.650
Mr. Zhang is dead.

07:55.650 --> 07:57.050
Manager Qin is also dead.

07:59.409 --> 08:00.000
Clean it up

08:00.000 --> 08:00.960
and report to the government.

08:00.960 --> 08:02.160
Everything was fine.

08:02.860 --> 08:04.260
Why are there deaths now?

08:04.300 --> 08:05.110
Everyone.

08:05.560 --> 08:06.160
Everyone.

08:07.920 --> 08:09.010
Please stay calm.

08:09.350 --> 08:11.450
A few friends are drunk.

08:11.620 --> 08:12.960
No one is dead. I promise.

08:12.960 --> 08:14.770
[Kindhearted and Serene]

08:13.360 --> 08:15.120
Please continue enjoying your drinks.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.430
Don't listen to the servants' nonsense.

08:16.430 --> 08:17.000
Please.

08:17.070 --> 08:18.000
Please.

08:19.590 --> 08:20.640
Drink up.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.310
Make a decision already!

08:22.310 --> 08:23.240
Just decide who's the buyer

08:23.240 --> 08:24.420
and we'll leave!

08:24.530 --> 08:25.790
We'll do it right away.

08:26.240 --> 08:27.300
Here, have a drink.

08:27.630 --> 08:28.490
What happened?

08:28.830 --> 08:30.160
Mr. Zhang from Hangzhou

08:30.160 --> 08:31.680
and his bodyguards are dead.

08:31.680 --> 08:33.080
The Li family from Huzhou,

08:33.080 --> 08:34.669
and the Wang family from Suzhou.

08:34.669 --> 08:36.480
All those who made a bid just now are...

08:36.480 --> 08:37.150
Yes.

08:37.900 --> 08:40.020
Everyone who made a bid is dead.

08:42.320 --> 08:43.740
She's from the south.

08:47.050 --> 08:47.960
I'm sure she's going to

08:47.960 --> 08:49.160
drag our family down.

08:49.990 --> 08:51.850
We need to find a way to fight back.

09:02.110 --> 09:02.870
Ms. Su.

09:04.870 --> 09:05.870
My boss ordered me

09:06.200 --> 09:07.320
to make absolutely sure

09:07.320 --> 09:08.510
I secure the Kang family's property.

09:08.510 --> 09:09.840
Could you let me take it?

09:12.110 --> 09:14.170
Those people died horribly just now.

09:15.270 --> 09:15.870
It was you?

09:18.650 --> 09:19.200
You're not planning

09:19.200 --> 09:20.600
to join them, are you?

09:24.280 --> 09:24.720
No.

09:29.790 --> 09:30.580
I think

09:30.910 --> 09:33.240
someone is trying
to force the Eight Families to death,

09:33.240 --> 09:34.770
wanting to take everything

09:35.080 --> 09:36.340
without paying a coin.

09:37.870 --> 09:39.480
Was it done by people from the underworld?

09:39.480 --> 09:40.410
I don't think so.

09:41.270 --> 09:42.410
They don't have

09:42.750 --> 09:44.320
that kind of power.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.720
We should stay put

09:47.270 --> 09:49.330
and let the culprit show themselves.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.090
Dead people!

09:53.390 --> 09:54.870
There really are dead people!

09:54.870 --> 09:56.330
Make up your mind already!

09:57.550 --> 09:58.150
Everyone!

09:58.270 --> 09:58.870
Everyone!

10:00.000 --> 10:02.240
Today I'm selling
the Kang family's assets.

10:02.240 --> 10:04.170
I truly don't know why people died.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.680
We're not doing a deal

10:05.960 --> 10:07.000
where we die!

10:07.630 --> 10:08.160
Let's go!

10:08.360 --> 10:09.630
Let's go!

10:10.600 --> 10:11.320
Every-

10:12.030 --> 10:13.510
Get back!

10:14.910 --> 10:16.200
-Sit down!
-Sit down!

10:30.510 --> 10:31.840
By His Highness's order,

10:31.840 --> 10:32.920
no one drinking here today

10:32.920 --> 10:34.050
is allowed to leave!

10:34.790 --> 10:36.510
If the Kang family's property isn't sold

10:36.510 --> 10:38.320
and the military supplies
can't be delivered,

10:38.320 --> 10:39.780
you can all prepare to die!

10:40.550 --> 10:41.680
Sit down, all of you!

10:42.910 --> 10:44.170
Continue the bidding!

10:59.030 --> 10:59.950
Seven million taels.

10:59.950 --> 11:01.330
[Kindhearted and Serene]

11:01.480 --> 11:02.150
Manager Li,

11:02.670 --> 11:04.000
since they're all dead,

11:04.200 --> 11:05.670
I'll follow your bid.

11:06.320 --> 11:06.670
Okay.

11:07.200 --> 11:08.260
Alright, alright.

11:09.030 --> 11:09.630
Alright.

11:10.600 --> 11:11.600
Clever.

11:17.790 --> 11:18.990
Eight million taels.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.100
Ten million taels.

11:24.840 --> 11:25.960
Young man,

11:27.000 --> 11:28.200
you look unfamiliar.

11:29.390 --> 11:30.870
As long as you know it, that's enough.

11:30.870 --> 11:32.470
It's not unfamiliar, right?

11:36.600 --> 11:37.860
Eleven million taels!

11:38.920 --> 11:40.270
Everyone, I'll place a bid too.

11:40.270 --> 11:40.870
I'd like to see

11:40.870 --> 11:42.330
if I will get killed today.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.400
Fourteen million taels!

11:51.030 --> 11:52.360
Fifteen million taels!

11:53.870 --> 11:55.130
No matter what you bid,

11:55.270 --> 11:57.130
I'll always add another million.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.480
Everyone, forgive me.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.120
I must win today.

12:05.390 --> 12:06.050
Hurry up!

12:06.360 --> 12:07.160
Any more bids?

12:10.120 --> 12:11.380
Twenty million taels!

12:16.390 --> 12:17.120
What?

12:18.360 --> 12:20.360
Is Li Baiwan's family in the capital

12:20.960 --> 12:21.760
not eligible?

12:29.030 --> 12:30.830
You're joining too, aren't you?

12:31.600 --> 12:32.320
Yes.

12:33.390 --> 12:34.450
Quite lively here.

12:36.790 --> 12:38.790
But you're not go to do this...

12:39.790 --> 12:41.120
to me and Mr. Gu, are you?

12:42.390 --> 12:43.440
What are you trying to do?

12:43.440 --> 12:44.960
I'm thinking the same as you.

12:44.960 --> 12:46.620
I want to snatch this bargain.

12:50.440 --> 12:52.040
Didn't you say you'd help me?

12:53.600 --> 12:54.390
Come on.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.210
What was your bid again?

12:58.510 --> 12:59.320
Twenty million taels.

12:59.320 --> 12:59.870
Twenty...

12:59.870 --> 13:01.070
Twenty-one million!

13:04.550 --> 13:05.890
Twenty-five million!

13:08.270 --> 13:09.670
Twenty-six million!

13:10.360 --> 13:11.870
Even if you boiled Wang Tiangui's bones
into oil,

13:11.870 --> 13:13.730
you couldn't get that much money.

13:14.150 --> 13:15.550
I have it in my draft bank.

13:16.910 --> 13:17.970
I'll lend it to him.

13:18.750 --> 13:20.480
I'm doing this for your father.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.790
Why are you interfering?

13:21.790 --> 13:22.630
Spending 26 million

13:22.630 --> 13:23.820
can make you happy?

13:24.510 --> 13:26.040
Do you know what I want most?

13:26.320 --> 13:28.280
I want to see you and my father

13:28.360 --> 13:30.060
defeated just once.

13:34.390 --> 13:35.270
Childish.

13:47.470 --> 13:48.560
Mr. Gu, right?

13:50.000 --> 13:51.260
Please come over here.

13:52.240 --> 13:52.840
Everyone,

13:53.080 --> 13:54.840
if there are no objections,

13:55.930 --> 13:57.660
the Kang family's property...

13:58.840 --> 14:00.300
now belongs to Taiyufeng.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.350
Manager Kang,

14:07.460 --> 14:09.480
26 million taels is a large sum.

14:09.910 --> 14:12.120
Please allow me
to settle it within 10 days.

14:12.120 --> 14:12.720
Thank you.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.840
With so much money,

14:17.630 --> 14:18.830
why did you kill them?

14:19.280 --> 14:20.510
Madam, what are you thinking?

14:20.510 --> 14:21.610
I didn't kill them.

14:22.240 --> 14:22.750
Good.

14:23.150 --> 14:24.030
From now on, Taiyufeng

14:24.030 --> 14:25.960
will be part of the Eight Families.

14:26.030 --> 14:27.690
Congratulations, Mr. Gu.

14:30.120 --> 14:31.180
Congratulations.

14:33.840 --> 14:35.300
His Highness has arrived!

14:37.080 --> 14:38.480
Why is His Highness here?

14:48.910 --> 14:49.770
Your Highness.

14:55.400 --> 14:57.000
The rebels are running rampant,

14:56.840 --> 15:00.080
[Prince Shen]

14:58.000 --> 15:00.510
and the imperial court
is pressing urgently.

15:00.510 --> 15:02.110
Without money and supplies,

15:02.240 --> 15:03.840
the army can't be sustained.

15:04.840 --> 15:06.770
You can't afford to take the blame.

15:07.150 --> 15:08.720
I am selling off my family property.

15:08.720 --> 15:09.360
Within 10 days,

15:09.360 --> 15:11.290
I'll repay the military supplies.

15:11.790 --> 15:12.840
Ten days?

15:13.120 --> 15:15.120
Is this what the Eight Families do?

15:18.080 --> 15:19.480
The country is in crisis,

15:19.600 --> 15:21.440
yet you're all here haggling.

15:23.120 --> 15:24.650
The imperial court says I'm

15:25.510 --> 15:26.820
too soft-hearted.

15:27.910 --> 15:29.370
Well, I have no choice now.

15:29.720 --> 15:30.840
Lock them all up.

15:32.110 --> 15:33.480
At least I'll have something to report.

15:33.480 --> 15:34.070
Yes!

15:34.120 --> 15:34.980
Take them away!

15:39.030 --> 15:40.750
If you don't pay within 3 days...

15:40.750 --> 15:41.260
-Go!
-Go!

15:41.260 --> 15:42.660
None of you will survive.

15:43.720 --> 15:44.250
Hurry up!

15:44.360 --> 15:44.690
Move!

15:44.720 --> 15:45.120
Hurry!

15:45.720 --> 15:46.180
Move it!

15:46.200 --> 15:46.640
Move!

15:47.030 --> 15:47.390
Move!

15:47.600 --> 15:47.910
Go!

15:47.960 --> 15:48.390
Move!

15:49.360 --> 15:49.720
Go!

15:51.910 --> 15:53.570
You think having a bit of money

15:53.960 --> 15:55.340
makes you humans?

15:55.480 --> 15:56.360
To me,

15:57.670 --> 16:00.170
you're nothing.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.120
Move!

16:02.120 --> 16:02.600
Hurry!

16:04.030 --> 16:04.600
Move!

16:05.200 --> 16:05.670
Hurry!

16:12.630 --> 16:13.240
Well?

16:13.870 --> 16:15.050
Your brother's head

16:15.080 --> 16:16.740
will fall faster than his hat.

16:22.200 --> 16:22.600
Gu...

17:00.600 --> 17:01.460
It's gone sour.

17:06.200 --> 17:07.859
Stop drinking—it's spoiled.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.839
Sour or not, it's still food.

17:19.200 --> 17:19.720
Mr. Gu,

17:20.480 --> 17:21.200
tell them

17:21.750 --> 17:23.400
you're not one of the Eight Families.

17:23.400 --> 17:25.000
You don't need to suffer here.

17:25.000 --> 17:25.750
I told them,

17:26.000 --> 17:27.200
but they wouldn't listen.

17:27.200 --> 17:27.750
They think

17:27.750 --> 17:29.480
since I bought the Kang family's property,

17:29.480 --> 17:31.340
I'm one of the Eight Families now.

17:31.480 --> 17:33.480
Let's face this hardship together.

17:33.830 --> 17:35.160
I'm afraid by tomorrow,

17:35.510 --> 17:36.720
even this spoiled porridge will be gone.

17:36.720 --> 17:37.920
Would you like a bowl?

17:39.190 --> 17:42.660
[Wanyuandang]

17:41.510 --> 17:43.070
I came to take over Shanxi.

17:48.510 --> 17:49.240
With the way they run things—

17:49.240 --> 17:51.300
small operations, small ambitions—

17:51.830 --> 17:53.560
they can't keep their footing.

17:53.830 --> 17:54.510
Before I came,

17:54.510 --> 17:55.640
I told His Highness.

17:57.070 --> 17:59.070
I'm opening a draft bank right here.

17:59.790 --> 18:01.480
I've already thought of the name.

18:01.480 --> 18:03.640
It will be called Taiping Bank.

18:04.960 --> 18:05.640
From Pingyao,

18:05.640 --> 18:07.900
it will spread to all the nearby counties

18:07.920 --> 18:09.720
and eventually across
the entire Qing Empire.

18:09.720 --> 18:11.810
Taiping Bank will be a big pouch,

18:11.920 --> 18:13.240
swallowing every draft bank

18:13.240 --> 18:14.350
in Pingyao.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.680
It's a fine business.

18:17.790 --> 18:19.320
The Li family in the capital

18:19.440 --> 18:21.640
will take over the draft bank business.

18:22.480 --> 18:24.550
Three million taels in ransom
for each family?

18:24.550 --> 18:26.550
Isn't that bleeding the locals dry?

18:27.030 --> 18:28.960
How could he even come up with that?

18:29.270 --> 18:30.150
The imperial court
has been asking us for money

18:30.150 --> 18:31.550
quite a lot over the past few years.

18:31.550 --> 18:33.030
Have they won any battles?

18:33.680 --> 18:35.000
Just wait till I get out.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.400
I have connections with a few people

18:36.400 --> 18:37.600
in the Grand Council.

18:37.830 --> 18:40.350
I'll buy myself an imperial censor
and impeach him!

18:40.350 --> 18:41.880
Mr. Sun, don't be angry.

18:42.960 --> 18:43.920
In this situation,

18:43.920 --> 18:45.510
without paying, none of us is getting out.

18:45.510 --> 18:46.350
How will you ever get the chance

18:46.350 --> 18:47.270
to buy yourself an imperial censor

18:47.270 --> 18:48.200
and impeach him?

18:48.830 --> 18:49.970
He's the famous

18:50.000 --> 18:51.240
Prince of the Iron Helmet.

18:51.240 --> 18:52.970
His words can shake mountains.

18:53.160 --> 18:54.820
You think you can impeach him?

18:55.350 --> 18:56.410
You've got a point.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.650
I'm just curious about one thing.

18:58.830 --> 19:00.630
At the Jinyang Villa gathering,

19:01.000 --> 19:02.270
all the people we invited

19:02.270 --> 19:04.030
are from the major banks in Shanxi.

19:04.030 --> 19:05.630
How did they know so clearly?

19:05.720 --> 19:06.880
They blocked the door

19:06.880 --> 19:08.210
and arrested everyone.

19:08.720 --> 19:09.590
I don't think

19:10.240 --> 19:11.840
this is as simple as it looks.

19:20.030 --> 19:20.720
Father,

19:21.030 --> 19:21.830
you're here.

19:28.030 --> 19:28.680
Well now.

19:29.390 --> 19:30.790
It all depends on you now.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.000
You two talk.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.640
Why are you always hanging around

19:40.640 --> 19:41.880
with that exile?

19:43.200 --> 19:45.160
You already know what we've been doing?

19:45.160 --> 19:46.310
We created a storefront pawning

19:46.310 --> 19:47.910
and a door-to-door pawning.

19:47.960 --> 19:48.680
We've turned Pingyao

19:48.680 --> 19:49.590
upside down.

19:49.640 --> 19:50.960
It was truly satisfying.

19:50.960 --> 19:52.160
You may be satisfied,

19:52.400 --> 19:54.110
but who will take the blame for harboring

19:54.110 --> 19:54.680
an exile?

19:54.720 --> 19:56.240
That won't fall on you.

19:56.270 --> 19:57.000
Don't worry.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.370
Just tell me,

19:58.680 --> 20:00.510
why did you really come here?

20:10.680 --> 20:11.880
I sincerely apologize

20:11.880 --> 20:13.700
for the inconvenience.

20:16.350 --> 20:18.070
His Highness asked me to check

20:18.480 --> 20:19.680
whether you ate well.

20:24.440 --> 20:26.680
You are all his guests.

20:27.510 --> 20:28.200
If there's anything lacking

20:28.200 --> 20:29.800
lacking in our hospitality,

20:29.920 --> 20:31.510
please forgive us.

20:32.070 --> 20:34.790
Your prince is too kind.

20:38.270 --> 20:39.350
I don't have

20:39.680 --> 20:40.610
3 million taels.

20:40.960 --> 20:42.690
All my money is invested in tea.

20:44.270 --> 20:45.240
Go confiscate my household

20:45.240 --> 20:46.640
with an imperial decree.

20:46.830 --> 20:47.830
I'm not qualified

20:47.830 --> 20:48.880
to be His Highness's guest.

20:48.880 --> 20:50.480
I don't have that much money.

20:51.880 --> 20:52.940
About this matter,

20:53.000 --> 20:55.130
we've already spoken to His Highness.

20:55.400 --> 20:55.930
However,

20:56.070 --> 20:57.870
His Highness has a noble status.

20:58.310 --> 20:59.290
If he takes back

20:59.590 --> 21:00.640
what he said,

21:00.830 --> 21:02.440
he'll lose face, won't he?

21:03.310 --> 21:04.160
The money in our draft banks

21:04.160 --> 21:05.790
belongs to the people of Shanxi.

21:05.790 --> 21:07.190
If it's all taken at once,

21:07.270 --> 21:08.870
how will the people survive?

21:09.000 --> 21:10.000
The imperial court

21:10.000 --> 21:11.400
has already lost Jiangnan.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.400
Now they want Shanxi

21:12.400 --> 21:13.660
to fall into chaos too?

21:16.080 --> 21:17.130
Young man,

21:18.110 --> 21:19.400
you look unfamiliar.

21:20.480 --> 21:23.080
May I know your name?

21:23.350 --> 21:24.350
Everyone in this room

21:24.350 --> 21:25.350
has only one name—

21:26.070 --> 21:27.110
Silver.

21:27.270 --> 21:28.270
Nickname: Ingot.

21:29.240 --> 21:30.040
That's right.

21:30.830 --> 21:31.510
Sir,

21:32.350 --> 21:34.000
stop pretending to be polite.

21:34.000 --> 21:35.160
State your terms.

21:36.270 --> 21:36.790
Fine.

21:38.200 --> 21:40.000
This time, His Highness brought

21:40.110 --> 21:41.770
a draft bank from the capital,

21:42.070 --> 21:43.790
planning to station it in Shanxi

21:43.790 --> 21:46.230
to manage the army's grain and funds.

21:46.880 --> 21:48.160
If you can't raise

21:48.240 --> 21:49.620
the 3 million taels,

21:50.070 --> 21:52.200
that draft bank can pay on your behalf.

21:53.480 --> 21:55.880
You just need to sign
and stamp your names.

21:58.160 --> 21:58.870
As for

21:59.070 --> 22:00.480
when you repay it,

22:02.200 --> 22:05.120
you may discuss that among yourselves.

22:05.310 --> 22:06.230
Robbers.

22:06.350 --> 22:07.350
Strange things happen every year,

22:07.350 --> 22:08.790
but this year is overflowing with them.

22:08.790 --> 22:10.520
Pingyao now has a Wanyuandang,

22:10.550 --> 22:11.480
said to be owned

22:11.550 --> 22:13.750
by the son of Li Baiwan from the capital.

22:13.830 --> 22:16.030
And now there's another big draft bank.

22:17.510 --> 22:18.480
Our Eight Families

22:18.480 --> 22:20.030
need a total of 24 million taels,

22:20.030 --> 22:20.830
and they do in fact have it.

22:20.830 --> 22:22.680
How can they be so rich?

22:23.240 --> 22:24.070
Could it be

22:24.400 --> 22:26.530
the God of Wealth himself has arrived?

22:28.270 --> 22:29.350
Madam Jin,

22:29.880 --> 22:30.790
this draft bank

22:31.200 --> 22:34.160
belongs to Mr. Li, Li Wantang.

22:34.510 --> 22:35.970
It's called Taiping Bank.

22:36.160 --> 22:38.820
If you all accept this account

22:39.160 --> 22:40.490
and are willing to sign,

22:40.830 --> 22:42.020
I guarantee

22:43.000 --> 22:44.060
you'll be released

22:44.270 --> 22:45.400
immediately.

22:51.480 --> 22:52.510
This Li Baiwan

22:52.750 --> 22:53.960
is too ruthless.

22:54.830 --> 22:56.890
Just to establish himself in Shanxi,

22:57.000 --> 22:57.830
there's no need

22:57.830 --> 22:59.570
to ruin all of us.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.000
What is this?

23:02.110 --> 23:03.910
Using officials to pressure us?

23:05.830 --> 23:07.090
Since that's the case,

23:07.920 --> 23:08.640
you can

23:09.200 --> 23:10.860
keep drinking your porridge!

23:23.200 --> 23:23.790
Father,

23:24.680 --> 23:25.810
is this really okay?

23:27.880 --> 23:28.770
You...

23:30.070 --> 23:30.790
Just be good.

23:30.790 --> 23:31.990
Don't cause trouble.

23:32.270 --> 23:33.720
As long as you can watch and learn

23:33.720 --> 23:34.650
from a distance,

23:35.440 --> 23:36.640
that's all I ask.

23:37.400 --> 23:37.860
Father,

23:38.750 --> 23:40.000
I believe businessmen

23:40.000 --> 23:40.960
should keep their word.

23:40.960 --> 23:41.960
What you're doing

23:42.240 --> 23:43.440
is robbery,

23:43.510 --> 23:44.640
bullying with power,

23:44.640 --> 23:45.480
kicking people when they're down—

23:45.480 --> 23:47.010
using any means necessary.

24:17.510 --> 24:18.570
My good son,

24:20.680 --> 24:21.480
I think you

24:21.480 --> 24:23.350
should just go back, study hard,

24:23.400 --> 24:25.260
and try to earn an official title.

24:28.480 --> 24:29.680
Be a good person?

24:32.090 --> 24:36.930
[Loan Ledger of Taiyufeng,
Eighth Year of the Xianfeng Reign]

24:35.030 --> 24:37.480
How much silver did His Highness get

24:38.720 --> 24:40.480
from Taiping Bank that made him

24:40.550 --> 24:41.720
pull off this stunt?

24:43.480 --> 24:45.860
No one really knows, I think.

24:46.590 --> 24:47.700
I just feel that

24:48.070 --> 24:50.200
you've barely joined the Eight Families,

24:50.200 --> 24:52.400
and already encountered such trouble.

25:03.000 --> 25:03.750
It's fake.

25:04.400 --> 25:05.920
Fake? What's fake?

25:06.240 --> 25:08.390
Which businessman

25:09.160 --> 25:11.000
would keep all their money

25:11.030 --> 25:13.040
in one place?

25:13.270 --> 25:14.480
Besides,

25:15.070 --> 25:16.870
which draft bank

25:17.110 --> 25:18.270
could even come up with

25:18.270 --> 25:21.110
3 million taels in cash?

25:22.830 --> 25:25.270
I think the demand for silver
is just a pretext.

25:25.270 --> 25:26.880
Taiping Bank wants to

25:26.920 --> 25:28.480
take over all the business

25:28.510 --> 25:29.920
of our draft banks

25:30.030 --> 25:31.560
for themselves.

25:31.830 --> 25:33.310
That's their real goal.

25:34.030 --> 25:36.720
Once these wealthy families
of the Eight Families

25:36.720 --> 25:38.310
sign the loan,

25:39.030 --> 25:40.160
they'll be as good as

25:40.510 --> 25:42.830
meat on someone's board.

25:43.590 --> 25:45.350
This Li Baiwan...

25:47.350 --> 25:48.850
is quite cunning.

26:11.890 --> 26:13.400
Is His Highness coming?

26:14.800 --> 26:16.090
I don't know.

26:19.160 --> 26:19.880
Everyone,

26:19.920 --> 26:21.400
please forgive me.

26:21.880 --> 26:23.000
I had no choice

26:23.030 --> 26:25.220
but to meet you in prison.

26:27.400 --> 26:28.250
Li Wantang?

26:29.830 --> 26:30.590
Mr. Li,

26:30.640 --> 26:32.070
are you here to mock us?

26:32.270 --> 26:33.200
I wouldn't dare.

26:35.110 --> 26:37.040
We're all in the same line of trade.

26:37.200 --> 26:38.680
I just came to see

26:38.750 --> 26:40.170
if I could be of any help.

26:42.740 --> 26:43.510
You could.

26:44.640 --> 26:45.480
Hurry and tell His Highness

26:45.480 --> 26:46.640
to release us.

26:47.270 --> 26:48.590
We didn't kill anyone
or set fire to anything.

26:48.590 --> 26:49.590
Keeping us here?

26:50.550 --> 26:51.590
How undignified.

26:53.880 --> 26:56.030
Since ancient times,
officials have had two mouths—

26:56.030 --> 26:58.490
the words from the two mouths
are different.

26:58.510 --> 27:00.440
Reasoning with them doesn't work.

27:01.880 --> 27:03.350
I can pay the 24 million taels first

27:03.350 --> 27:04.420
to help you

27:04.920 --> 27:07.110
escape this disaster.

27:07.590 --> 27:08.590
What do you think?

27:09.270 --> 27:10.910
What a show of power.

27:11.880 --> 27:13.530
The whole Qing Empire

27:13.720 --> 27:15.380
only makes this much in a year.

27:16.270 --> 27:18.130
What exactly are you trying to do?

27:22.000 --> 27:23.870
Times are tough, Madam.

27:25.510 --> 27:26.930
Those of us in business

27:27.160 --> 27:29.210
need to work together even more.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.680
I've been in the capital

27:30.680 --> 27:32.810
for too long, rarely visiting Shanxi,

27:33.030 --> 27:34.270
but I still have

27:34.880 --> 27:35.640
some influential connections

27:35.640 --> 27:37.200
at the imperial court.

27:39.750 --> 27:40.830
Consider this 3 million taels

27:40.830 --> 27:43.920
as my entry into the Eight Families.

27:44.510 --> 27:45.550
If you have any obstacles

27:45.550 --> 27:47.280
to overcome,

27:47.480 --> 27:48.210
Taiping Bank

27:48.550 --> 27:50.790
will help smooth them over.

27:52.510 --> 27:53.790
I'm not trying to take over

27:53.790 --> 27:54.960
the Eight Families.

27:55.720 --> 27:58.260
It's out of respect for your predecessors,

27:58.920 --> 28:00.720
offering my humble assistance.

28:02.960 --> 28:05.350
That's a bit much.

28:06.270 --> 28:08.130
That's not the right way to see it.

28:15.880 --> 28:16.510
Fine.

28:17.310 --> 28:18.720
If you don't agree,

28:19.550 --> 28:21.350
I'll just return to the capital.

28:21.480 --> 28:22.070
Fine.

28:22.830 --> 28:23.270
Fine.

28:23.960 --> 28:26.030
But the military situation is urgent,

28:26.030 --> 28:28.400
and His Highness has a fiery temper.

28:30.110 --> 28:31.440
When I came, he said,

28:32.920 --> 28:34.200
"The Eight Families"

28:34.270 --> 28:36.490
"hold King Li's Treasure."

28:37.200 --> 28:39.720
"Why won't they let go of
a little profits?"

28:41.550 --> 28:42.750
"It's infuriating."

28:43.240 --> 28:44.790
King Li's Treasure?

28:45.400 --> 28:46.480
Every child in Shanxi

28:46.480 --> 28:47.510
grows up knowing this story,

28:47.510 --> 28:48.110
right?

28:48.440 --> 28:48.790
Yes.

28:49.110 --> 28:50.640
You actually believe that?

28:52.590 --> 28:53.270
Weren't you here

28:53.270 --> 28:54.800
for King Li's Treasure too?

28:56.830 --> 28:59.560
Back then,
King Li's army was incredibly fierce.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.480
They came out of the Qinling Mountains,

29:01.480 --> 29:03.160
passed through the Taihang Mountains,

29:03.160 --> 29:05.820
broke through Tongguan Pass,
flooded Kaifeng,

29:06.160 --> 29:07.890
swept across the Yellow River,

29:08.030 --> 29:09.960
and conquered the Central Plains.

29:09.960 --> 29:10.480
But what happened

29:10.480 --> 29:12.210
after they got all that wealth?

29:13.790 --> 29:15.310
The generals indulged in pleasure,

29:15.310 --> 29:16.590
the soldiers feared death,

29:16.590 --> 29:17.670
and in the end

29:17.720 --> 29:19.480
they came to a mysterious downfall.

29:19.480 --> 29:20.540
What was it all for?

29:20.880 --> 29:22.540
That's truly a terrible omen.

29:24.310 --> 29:27.000
Those words are really insightful.

29:31.170 --> 29:33.750
You're... Gu Pingyuan?

29:40.440 --> 29:40.920
Yes.

29:43.000 --> 29:45.400
My son mentions you often.

29:50.310 --> 29:52.550
Your words show great insight.

29:53.720 --> 29:54.440
However,

29:55.110 --> 29:56.970
that's a scholar's perspective.

29:57.160 --> 29:59.510
If you want to go into business
in the future,

29:59.510 --> 30:01.680
that would be a big mistake.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.280
What mistake?

30:07.110 --> 30:08.270
Gold and silver

30:08.720 --> 30:10.590
are public tools of the world.

30:11.310 --> 30:13.310
They carry no inherent good or evil.

30:13.720 --> 30:15.050
People are responsible

30:15.240 --> 30:16.570
for their own mistakes.

30:17.240 --> 30:18.440
Blaming money itself

30:18.880 --> 30:19.750
makes no sense.

30:22.350 --> 30:24.660
There is no money that cannot be used,

30:26.790 --> 30:28.720
no person that cannot be employed.

30:33.350 --> 30:34.270
Remember that.

31:13.110 --> 31:15.640
I, Li Wantang,
pay respects to Your Highness.

31:16.550 --> 31:18.000
Your plan didn't work.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.460
The imperial court

31:43.750 --> 31:46.270
ordered me to go to Shandong
to suppress the rebellion,

31:46.270 --> 31:48.020
but I keep delaying my advance.

31:48.640 --> 31:50.540
If I hold up
the imperial court's important matters,

31:50.540 --> 31:51.670
who takes the blame,

31:52.070 --> 31:53.270
you or me?

31:57.030 --> 31:57.980
Your Highness.

31:59.640 --> 32:01.900
These merchants are extremely cunning.

32:02.270 --> 32:03.870
If we don't wait long enough,

32:03.880 --> 32:05.510
this won't succeed.

32:07.640 --> 32:08.580
Each of them

32:09.200 --> 32:11.920
is well-connected
with powerful officials at court.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.560
If they find a censor

32:13.750 --> 32:16.200
and report me for bleeding the locals dry,

32:17.480 --> 32:18.880
I won't be able to handle it.

32:18.880 --> 32:19.740
Your Highness.

32:20.640 --> 32:22.160
I'm a businessman.

32:23.270 --> 32:25.070
I understand businessmen best.

32:25.750 --> 32:26.720
These wealthy people

32:26.720 --> 32:28.720
may look generous from the outside,

32:29.160 --> 32:30.150
but deep down,

32:30.720 --> 32:32.650
every single one of them is stingy.

32:32.830 --> 32:35.030
Their money
is practically glued to their ribs.

32:35.030 --> 32:37.000
When you really ask them to hand it over,

32:37.000 --> 32:39.000
you'd need a pair of pliers
to pull it out,

32:39.000 --> 32:40.400
with the strength

32:40.400 --> 32:42.060
of ripping out their tendons.

32:43.310 --> 32:44.440
Three million taels

32:45.400 --> 32:47.000
won't come that easily.

32:52.640 --> 32:54.070
If you don't push them

32:54.110 --> 32:56.220
to the brink,

32:56.270 --> 32:58.960
you'll never get what you want.

33:01.720 --> 33:02.880
Does...

33:08.830 --> 33:10.630
King Li's Treasure really exist

33:12.400 --> 33:13.200
in this world?

33:21.510 --> 33:22.710
Your Highness, look.

33:23.680 --> 33:24.790
Pingyao and Taigu

33:24.960 --> 33:28.860
are the birthplace of Shanxi's wealth.

33:29.030 --> 33:30.110
In terms of transportation,

33:30.110 --> 33:32.000
this region is surrounded by mountains.

33:32.000 --> 33:34.920
As for resources,
there are no gold or silver mines.

33:35.350 --> 33:36.200
As for talents,

33:36.200 --> 33:38.260
the people here are honest and plain,

33:38.270 --> 33:41.000
with no long tradition of doing business.

33:41.720 --> 33:43.720
Yet right after the Ming dynasty fell,

33:43.720 --> 33:46.830
these two places suddenly became rich.

33:48.000 --> 33:48.830
Now look here.

33:50.590 --> 33:52.140
This is Taihang Mountains.

33:52.310 --> 33:53.920
King Li fled along this route,

33:53.920 --> 33:56.050
spreading out from here to both sides.

33:57.350 --> 33:58.210
I'm certain...

33:59.830 --> 34:01.220
the treasure

34:02.000 --> 34:03.030
exists,

34:03.920 --> 34:04.590
and

34:05.750 --> 34:07.880
hasn't been much depleted.

34:09.840 --> 34:11.900
As for the so‑called Eight Families,

34:12.960 --> 34:14.360
they've been in business

34:14.840 --> 34:16.320
for generations.

34:18.280 --> 34:20.600
Business has its profits and losses.

34:21.320 --> 34:22.510
How have they stayed prosperous

34:22.510 --> 34:24.150
for over a hundred years?

34:25.360 --> 34:26.820
Where did their capital come from?

34:26.820 --> 34:28.800
How could this be possible?

34:31.510 --> 34:32.320
Li Wantang,

34:33.920 --> 34:34.960
Li Baiwan.

34:35.960 --> 34:37.000
You'd better

34:37.030 --> 34:38.060
not be wrong.

34:39.800 --> 34:42.030
I burned the military supplies,

34:43.000 --> 34:44.280
and that was your idea.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.360
If I delay the military operations,

34:46.360 --> 34:47.820
fail to find the treasure,

34:48.070 --> 34:50.600
and lose the military supplies
on top of that,

34:51.280 --> 34:52.610
then I'll have no choice

34:53.060 --> 34:54.820
but to use your head

34:55.440 --> 34:56.699
to make up for the loss.

34:58.230 --> 34:59.830
Your Highness, don't worry.

34:59.880 --> 35:00.550
Trust me.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.070
By then,

35:02.760 --> 35:04.290
the treasure will be yours,

35:04.360 --> 35:05.690
and Shanxi will be mine.

35:06.670 --> 35:09.000
As long as you understand what's at stake.

35:09.710 --> 35:10.540
Within 3 days,

35:10.710 --> 35:13.170
make up the money
for the military supplies.

35:13.270 --> 35:14.280
No matter what,

35:14.840 --> 35:17.370
I have to cross the Yellow River
into Shandong

35:18.150 --> 35:19.520
and fight this battle.

35:38.800 --> 35:39.440
Kang,

35:40.590 --> 35:42.120
how could you be so careless

35:42.510 --> 35:43.070
as to let

35:43.110 --> 35:44.850
the military supplies

35:45.010 --> 35:45.670
get burned?

35:45.880 --> 35:47.610
You think I wanted them burned?

35:48.280 --> 35:49.920
I never wanted to take the deal
in the first place.

35:49.920 --> 35:50.800
The local officials

35:50.800 --> 35:51.800
forced me to do it.

35:52.110 --> 35:52.760
The fire

35:53.230 --> 35:54.690
must have been set by them.

35:56.000 --> 35:57.730
Putting everything together,

35:59.250 --> 36:00.960
this might be a chain of traps.

36:01.320 --> 36:03.070
They burned
His Highness's military supplies,

36:03.070 --> 36:04.960
forced the Kang family
to sell their property,

36:04.960 --> 36:05.590
then

36:06.670 --> 36:08.150
arrested everyone—

36:08.590 --> 36:11.390
step by step
leading to the situation we're in now.

36:11.480 --> 36:12.830
Even if every one of you

36:12.920 --> 36:13.630
could bring out

36:13.630 --> 36:14.960
3 million taels in cash,

36:15.320 --> 36:16.070
they would still

36:16.070 --> 36:17.200
keep squeezing you.

36:17.630 --> 36:19.410
Because what they truly want

36:20.000 --> 36:21.260
is King Li's Treasure.

36:34.110 --> 36:35.550
Why do people in this world

36:35.550 --> 36:36.960
love to talk nonsense?

36:42.400 --> 36:43.550
As the saying goes,

36:44.030 --> 36:46.320
"a gentleman's only crime
is to carry a jade."

36:46.320 --> 36:47.590
Whether we admit it or not,

36:47.590 --> 36:48.960
as long as they believe we have it,

36:48.960 --> 36:49.840
we're guilty.

36:51.150 --> 36:51.960
I'm thinking

36:52.030 --> 36:53.830
that this stalemate can't go on.

36:54.280 --> 36:55.940
We should talk to His Highness

36:56.440 --> 36:58.440
and have both sides take a step back.

37:04.590 --> 37:05.860
Such childish talk.

37:06.840 --> 37:08.510
Why would he take a step back?

37:09.150 --> 37:10.400
To the government,

37:10.670 --> 37:12.600
we're nothing but ants.

37:15.360 --> 37:16.760
If they find out

37:16.840 --> 37:17.440
we don't have

37:17.440 --> 37:18.900
King Li's Treasure at all,

37:20.070 --> 37:23.330
we probably won't even get
this spoiled porridge anymore.

37:23.510 --> 37:24.670
That makes sense.

37:31.510 --> 37:32.320
Do you

37:32.880 --> 37:33.670
really have

37:33.710 --> 37:34.920
3 million taels in cash

37:34.920 --> 37:36.030
on hand right now?

37:36.710 --> 37:38.150
We already said we don't.

37:39.190 --> 37:41.190
The money in the draft banks
belongs to the depositors.

37:41.190 --> 37:42.170
Our own capital

37:42.510 --> 37:43.770
is all tied up in goods.

37:44.000 --> 37:45.000
You don't have it.

37:46.150 --> 37:47.150
Even if you don't, we can't just

37:47.150 --> 37:48.360
sit here and let them push us to death,

37:48.360 --> 37:48.760
right?

37:51.150 --> 37:52.010
Then tell us,

37:52.440 --> 37:53.440
what should we do?

37:54.760 --> 37:55.640
I've been thinking—

37:55.640 --> 37:57.640
no matter how wealthy Li Wantang is,

37:57.880 --> 37:58.940
at the end of the day

37:59.030 --> 38:00.510
he's a merchant just like us.

38:00.510 --> 38:01.770
Everything he's doing

38:01.800 --> 38:02.670
is simply

38:02.710 --> 38:04.840
to seize control of all the draft banks

38:04.840 --> 38:05.840
in Shanxi.

38:06.960 --> 38:08.160
Here's what we can do.

38:08.550 --> 38:10.690
First, we give His Highness an IOU,

38:11.360 --> 38:13.760
pretending we're willing
to take on this debt

38:13.760 --> 38:15.290
and will deliver the silver

38:15.400 --> 38:16.660
on the date he sets. His

38:16.960 --> 38:17.690
His Highness

38:17.710 --> 38:19.040
isn't a local official.

38:19.280 --> 38:21.410
He could be called to war at any moment.

38:21.480 --> 38:23.230
24 million taels of silver

38:23.320 --> 38:24.190
can't be spent

38:24.230 --> 38:25.230
in just one night.

38:26.110 --> 38:27.360
As long as he gives us some time

38:27.360 --> 38:28.280
to maneuver,

38:28.570 --> 38:29.570
we can turn around

38:29.590 --> 38:30.320
and go all out

38:30.320 --> 38:31.440
against Li Wantang

38:32.630 --> 38:34.160
and force him out of Shanxi.

38:34.710 --> 38:35.230
I believe that

38:35.230 --> 38:36.960
without His Highness backing him,

38:36.960 --> 38:37.710
he wouldn't

38:37.760 --> 38:39.020
have such great power.

38:39.670 --> 38:40.510
No way.

38:42.400 --> 38:44.230
It's easy for the Eight Families
to accept the debt,

38:44.230 --> 38:45.940
but Li Wantang isn't a child.

38:46.360 --> 38:47.760
He has plenty of methods.

38:48.030 --> 38:49.330
If he makes this IOU

38:49.630 --> 38:50.320
public

38:50.670 --> 38:52.110
and announces that our draft banks

38:52.110 --> 38:53.770
owe the imperial court money,

38:54.000 --> 38:54.930
our credibility

38:55.360 --> 38:56.550
will be ruined overnight.

38:56.550 --> 38:57.920
The depositors will fear

38:57.920 --> 38:59.030
we're using their money

38:59.030 --> 39:01.230
to fill the imperial court's
bottomless pit.

39:01.230 --> 39:02.430
If there's a bank run,

39:02.960 --> 39:04.220
how could we handle it?

39:06.480 --> 39:07.190
Who says business

39:07.190 --> 39:08.990
must be done with actual silver?

39:14.590 --> 39:15.110
Bro,

39:15.480 --> 39:17.110
you've had too much spoiled porridge.

39:17.110 --> 39:18.370
Your brain's gone off.

39:22.400 --> 39:23.070
Madam.

39:23.880 --> 39:25.760
Right now none of us
has a single coin on hand.

39:25.760 --> 39:26.630
But I want to make a business deal

39:26.630 --> 39:27.920
of 100 thousand taels with you.

39:27.920 --> 39:28.920
Is that possible?

39:31.150 --> 39:32.110
For example,

39:32.190 --> 39:33.390
this bowl in your hand

39:33.550 --> 39:34.590
is worth 100 thousand taels.

39:34.590 --> 39:35.190
I want it.

39:36.280 --> 39:37.190
But all my money

39:37.230 --> 39:38.480
is deposited with Manager Sun.

39:38.480 --> 39:39.410
What should I do?

39:41.360 --> 39:42.090
Manager Sun,

39:42.280 --> 39:43.880
please give me 100 thousand taels.

39:43.880 --> 39:45.210
I don't have any silver.

39:45.360 --> 39:47.030
And even if I did, carrying it around

39:47.030 --> 39:48.150
would be troublesome.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.150
Your jade pendant looks quite nice.

39:51.320 --> 39:53.120
Could you give it to me as a token?

39:54.070 --> 39:54.800
That's easy.

39:58.960 --> 39:59.650
Madam,

40:00.070 --> 40:01.080
Manager Sun said

40:01.230 --> 40:03.030
that as long as you see this token,

40:03.030 --> 40:03.770
you'll know

40:03.800 --> 40:04.670
that the 100 thousand taels

40:04.670 --> 40:06.150
have already been credited
to your account.

40:06.150 --> 40:07.080
With this token,

40:07.110 --> 40:07.760
may I

40:07.800 --> 40:09.150
take this bowl now?

40:09.880 --> 40:11.480
Was this agreed upon before?

40:11.510 --> 40:13.110
When we conduct a real transaction,

40:13.110 --> 40:14.280
we need a contract.

40:14.840 --> 40:15.370
This way,

40:15.880 --> 40:17.000
the Eight Families can handle

40:17.000 --> 40:18.960
entries and records
from one account to another

40:18.960 --> 40:20.320
without using a single tael

40:20.320 --> 40:21.380
of cash.

40:21.920 --> 40:23.510
If there's a bank run,

40:23.550 --> 40:25.280
the combined strength
of the Eight Families

40:25.280 --> 40:27.340
will be more than enough to handle it.

40:27.510 --> 40:28.590
And if each family acts alone,

40:28.590 --> 40:30.050
each can use its own credit

40:30.070 --> 40:31.470
to guarantee the others.

40:31.590 --> 40:33.580
Transaction records must be kept

40:33.840 --> 40:35.280
for year-end accounting.

40:35.280 --> 40:36.190
As long as the business

40:36.190 --> 40:37.590
stays within the Eight Families,

40:37.590 --> 40:38.530
one written note

40:38.630 --> 40:40.430
can be worth a million in silver.

40:40.510 --> 40:41.840
What do you think of this method?

40:41.840 --> 40:42.690
But what if...

40:43.880 --> 40:44.760
What if one family

40:44.760 --> 40:45.960
breaks the rules?

40:47.400 --> 40:49.440
What if one of them faces a bank run

40:49.630 --> 40:51.490
and the others don't know in time,

40:51.510 --> 40:54.030
and the funds
can't be shifted quickly enough?

40:54.030 --> 40:54.560
And also,

40:55.150 --> 40:56.610
what if all Eight Families

40:56.800 --> 40:58.530
face a bank run at the same time?

40:59.630 --> 41:01.360
We can appoint a chief manager

41:01.880 --> 41:03.400
to check the funds every day

41:03.400 --> 41:04.660
and publicly announce

41:04.670 --> 41:06.030
an alliance of the Eight Families.

41:06.030 --> 41:07.550
That way, even if a bank run happens,

41:07.550 --> 41:09.210
the impact won't be too great.

41:09.440 --> 41:11.320
Maybe one or two families will suffer,

41:11.320 --> 41:12.230
but it shouldn't be too hard

41:12.230 --> 41:13.590
to handle.

41:13.920 --> 41:14.630
Good.

41:15.510 --> 41:16.440
It's truly good.

41:16.670 --> 41:17.400
If we had thought of

41:17.400 --> 41:18.200
this earlier,

41:18.550 --> 41:19.150
Li Baiwan

41:19.190 --> 41:20.710
would never have gained
a foothold in Shanxi,

41:20.710 --> 41:21.480
and we wouldn't have been

41:21.480 --> 41:23.340
taken advantage of by outsiders.

41:25.190 --> 41:26.400
So who will take

41:27.360 --> 41:29.020
this chief manager position?

41:32.590 --> 41:33.990
How about letting me try?

41:36.510 --> 41:37.970
It's just for show anyway,

41:38.190 --> 41:39.480
just to get through

41:39.550 --> 41:41.080
our current difficulties.

41:42.440 --> 41:43.180
That is,

41:43.300 --> 41:44.400
if you consider me

41:44.440 --> 41:45.530
one of your own.

41:45.840 --> 41:46.840
We've been eating

41:47.000 --> 41:49.280
spoiled porridge
from the same pot these past few days.

41:49.280 --> 41:50.740
Of course you're one of us.

41:51.150 --> 41:53.280
You're part of the Eight Families now.

41:53.880 --> 41:55.280
I don't think letting him join

41:55.280 --> 41:56.150
is a bad idea.

41:57.400 --> 41:57.930
Alright.

41:58.550 --> 42:00.150
You'll be the chief manager.

42:00.360 --> 42:01.470
It was your idea.

42:01.800 --> 42:03.400
Show everyone how it's done.

42:03.590 --> 42:05.250
Does anyone have objections?

42:12.800 --> 42:13.330
Alright.

42:14.000 --> 42:14.880
In that case,

42:15.360 --> 42:16.670
I hope by this time tomorrow,

42:16.670 --> 42:18.760
we're no longer eating spoiled porridge.

42:18.760 --> 42:20.360
I'll go negotiate with them.

42:22.710 --> 42:23.510
It's settled.

42:24.960 --> 42:25.820
Guards!

42:26.150 --> 42:27.610
I need to see His Highness!

42:28.440 --> 42:29.440
Send out my order.

42:29.480 --> 42:30.680
Deploy 20,000 troops

42:30.960 --> 42:32.280
to Mount Liang area

42:33.230 --> 42:34.790
and tighten the net.

42:37.760 --> 42:38.620
Your Highness.

42:42.760 --> 42:44.670
I would like to report to you on behalf of

42:44.670 --> 42:46.330
the Eight Families of Hedong.

42:46.470 --> 42:48.130
I request a private audience.

42:52.440 --> 42:53.570
A private audience?

42:54.590 --> 42:56.120
You think you deserve that?

42:56.280 --> 42:57.400
I don't, of course.

43:00.440 --> 43:01.300
But does silver

43:01.630 --> 43:02.760
deserve it?
